# Ethane (C2H6) H-C-C-H torsion metadynamics for ABACUS + PLUMED.
# The dihedral angle involves the atoms H3-C1-C2-H7 (1-based indices as in
# STRU); the initial structure is staggered (t = pi).
#
# ABACUS runs in atomic units, so the units of the configuration passed to
# PLUMED are declared below with UNITS.
UNITS LENGTH=A TIME=fs

# Collective variable: the H-C-C-H dihedral angle
t: TORSION ATOMS=3,1,2,7

# Well-tempered metadynamics at 600 K (same temperature as the NVT run)
metad: METAD ARG=t PACE=50 HEIGHT=2.0 SIGMA=0.15 FILE=HILLS BIASFACTOR=20 TEMP=600

# Write the collective variable and the bias at every MD step
PRINT ARG=t,metad.bias FILE=COLVAR STRIDE=1
